  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant contradicts the factual information provided in the reference regarding the required duration of residence (claiming 3 years instead of 5 years) and the scope of the treaty (implying a shorter, unspecified duration applies to unspecified 'certain countries' rather than the specific list of countries with the 5-year treaty). The answer provides false information that conflicts with the reference.",
  "evidence": "In de Regel erhält Bürger vo Länder, wo e C-Bewilligung für reguläre, ununterbrochne Wohne verlangt, d'C-Bewilligung, wenn si mindestens drei Johr lang regulär ununterbrochne in dr Schweiz gewohnt hend."
